sequenceDiagram
    actor You
    participant Bot as Telegram or CLI entry
    participant Runs as Task run store
    participant Orch as Hub orchestrator
    participant Mem as Hub memory store
    participant Reg as Agent registry
    participant Agent as Selected specialist

    You->>Bot: initial task
    Bot->>Orch: forward message
    Orch->>Mem: load relevant preferences
    Mem-->>Orch: active preference records
    Orch->>Reg: load enabled specialists
    Reg-->>Orch: callable agent specs
    Orch->>Orch: LLM chooses specialist
    Orch->>Runs: transition routed -> dispatched -> in_progress
    Orch->>Agent: dispatch bounded task

    Agent-->>Orch: status: needs_clarification
    Orch->>Runs: transition waiting_clarification
    Orch-->>Bot: relay clarification question
    Bot-->>You: specialist question

    You->>Bot: clarification reply
    Bot->>Orch: resume paused run
    Orch->>Runs: transition routed
    Orch->>Agent: resume with added clarification

    Agent-->>Orch: structured result
    Orch->>Runs: finalize succeeded
    Orch-->>Bot: operator-facing response
    Bot-->>You: result
